# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7035

### =========================
### STUDENTS
### =========================

### Success: Get all students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Students

### Failure: Student ID does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Students/999999


### =========================
### COURSES
### =========================

### Success: Get all courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Courses

### Failure: Course ID does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Courses/999999


### =========================
### ENROLLMENTS
### =========================

### Success: Get all enrollments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Enrollments

### Failure: Enrollment ID does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Enrollments/999999

